<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.6">
  <book code="NEH" style="id">Baebu Thyaa</book>
  <para style="h">NEHEMIAH</para>
  <para style="toc1">Nehemiah</para>
  <para style="toc2">NEHEMIAH</para>
  <para style="toc3">Neh</para>
  <para style="mt1">NEHEMIAH</para>
  <para style="mt2">Nehemiah</para>
  <para style="imt">Byalaanmaw</para>
  <para style="ip">
    <char style="bk">Nehemiah</char> ccauh hynh phuin pali lang phia kho athua:</para>
  <para style="ip">(1) Persia siapharan nynh Judah ram uk lan a sawpaw Nehemiah nynh Jerusalem lang kinaw;</para>
  <para style="ip">(2) Jerusalem khualungrua raethuinaw;</para>
  <para style="ip">(3) Ezra nynh Pachia Kawbya kha riapah hae zah zapi hae nynh mih seinaw a phyku hae;</para>
  <para style="ip">(4) Judah ram mangki Nehemiah nynh ccangpaw a lawpaw rya hae.</para>
  <para style="ip">Nehemiah tuh Pachia kha myarya a doliakuhpaw thua zah Pachia kalan saw a sang zungzaepaw nynh thua.</para>
  <para style="iot">Abyalupi hae</para>
  <para style="io1">Jerusalem lang Nehemiah a ki 1.1—2.20</para>
  <para style="io1">Jerusalem khualungrua a raethui hae 3.1—7.73</para>
  <para style="io1">Kawbya kha ria hae zah byakinnaw a thawsah thui hae 8.1—10.39</para>
  <para style="io1">Ccangpaw Nehemiah ryalawnaw hae 11.1—13.31</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Nehemiah Sawsangnaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Hakaliah ccapaw Nehemiah bya. Kum kuinnaw kum, Khislev sawpaw lya Susa khuapi kya ka um lyakhe, <verse number="2" style="v" />ka unopaw Hanani tuh Judah ram e ccungccaw abang ryte oun thua hae; te kae nynh seetangnaw kyate a lue hae paw a hiin ung hae paw Judah hae kong te Jerusalem kong kha ka khia hae. <verse number="3" style="v" />Minmin nynh, “Seetangnaw kyate lue hae zah tuin ram kya a hiin ung hae paw tuh myarya ccihpaw vawsawnaw te maethyanaw kha a teing hae; Jerusalem khualungrua tuh ting zah a koikua hae tuh maee nynh marya a ro,” cite a hopya hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />E bya hae he ka thae te, ka haung zah rawkhuite nin patae ka um zah looh-aesungte vaawlang Pachia kalan saw ka sang. <verse number="5" style="v" />“Pou <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char>, vaawlang Pachia, nang ae sungsah hae paw te na kawbya a zui hae paw tungvaw kya byakinnaw te atynpaw na sungsahnaw kha na tynsahtupaw, lesae zah ri lan umpaw Pachia, <verse number="6" style="v" />Israel ccungccaw hae nynh na tungvaw kae seinaw kha phykute, na ryalahtu Israel ccungccaw hae hanlan na ryalahtupaw kae nynh khuazi khuadae namaw malang saw ka sangpaw hynh thaepya khylan beih yn ngaepah lah, beih yn dotua. Kae te ka puizia hae tuh kae sei vae. <verse number="7" style="v" />Na tungvaw myaryamaw kae sei zah, na ryalahtu Moses kya kaw na pyapaw kawbya hae, kawbya hae te phungzae hae kha kae zui khyh. <verse number="8" style="v" />Na ryalahtu Moses kha kaw na pya zah, ‘Nae lungzi khyh zetuh, minphuin hae laku kya kae phiasakuh cih oh;<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 26:33">Lev 26.33</ref></char></note> <verse number="9" style="v" />thuasalama ka kalan nae ki oh zah ka kawbya hae kha na zui oh zah na rae oh zetuh, a theihrya hae paw nae ccungccaw hae kha vaawlui zakaw asaw huaccenaw lang dee athua hae zemah, tuin kyate ka pum cih hae zah ka min tynsah nawlan ka popaw hmin kalan ka cciakhae cih hae,’ na cipyapaw bya kha liathuitua.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 30:1-5">Deu 30.1-5</ref></char></note> <verse number="10" style="v" />Minmin tuh alesaepaw na huhan te athawsaepaw na kuih te na shawkhaw hae paw na ryalahtu hae te na ccungccaw hae nynh thua. <verse number="11" style="v" />Pou Bawipaw, na ryalahtupaw sawsangnaw hynh beih thaetua, te na min sawtuanaw kya a lungrythuapaw na ryalahtupaw sawsangnaw hynh beih thaetua. Atunin na ryalahtupaw hynh laansui-uanaw yn pya lah, e ccungccapaw muihnaw kya thawccinaw beih yn pyatua!” cite saw ka sang.</para>
  <para style="p">Tuh lya tuh kae tuh siapharan banang kyngtu nynh ka thua.</para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Nehemiah kha Judah Ram lang Sawnaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Siapharan Artazaksis nynh siapharan lang a tangnaw kum kuinnaw, Nisan sawpaw khe, amaw kha misutui dang athua lyakhe misutui kha ka ccyng zah siapharan kha ka pya. Tuh maw lya tuh amaw malang ka ngaethah boi khyh. <verse number="2" style="v" />Tukeiccuze siapharan nynh kae kha, “Mang na dan pite pawccemou na maesue hoy khyh rei? E hynh na thinlung a ngaethyanaw nynh thua,” cite yn cipya. Tetuh myarya ka rih. <verse number="3" style="v" />Kae nynh siapharan kha, “Siapharan tuh a hiinkhua zungzae sae vae sah! Ka minpaaw hae shawku a umnaw khua tuh roh zah a koikua hae tuh maee nynh marya a u lyakhe pawccemou ka maesue tuh ro leite a um cih?” ka cipya.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 25:8-10">2Si 25.8-10</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 36:19">2Sh 36.19</ref>; <ref loc="JER 52:12-14">Jer 52.12-14</ref></char></note> <verse number="4" style="v" />Te siapharan nynh kae kha, “Pawmou nae ngia ry?” yn cipya. Tukeiccuze vaawlang Pachia kalan saw ka sang. <verse number="5" style="v" />Te kae nynh siapharan kha, “Siapharan nynh na ry zah na ryalahtupaw nynh na tungvaw kya maehoynaw ka mue zetuh, kae minpaaw hae shawku a umnaw khua kha raethui khylan Judah ram lang, tuh-e khua kalan kae hynh beih yn saw,” ka cipya. <verse number="6" style="v" />Siapharan nynh kae kha (siapharan bawinung mah a pe a haung), “Na ccia ze hohsemou nae ro cih? Hohtuhmou nae ki cih?” yn cipya. Tuhcite siapharan nynh kae kha yn cciasah ry zah, kae nynh ninsaw kha ka hopya. <verse number="7" style="v" />Tukoute kae nynh siapharan kha, “Siapharan nynh na ry zetuh, Vaw Khuraw lang ram a uktu hae nynh kae hynh Judah ram ka thua cia ccianaw kaw yn ua nawlan hae ccaw beih yn pya; <verse number="8" style="v" />beikinn rhawlungrua sakoih hae hanlan, khua koihnawpaw khualungrua hanlan te ka umnaw lanpaw inn hanlan thing kha yn pya nawlan, siapharan tuhpi a uktu Asaf kalan pya lanpaw ccaw kha beih yn pya,” ka cipya. Ka Pachia a thawccinaw kuih tuh ka tungvaw a um keiccuze ka ngiapaw kha siapharan nynh yn ua.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Te Vaw Khuraw lang ram uktu hae kya ka thua zah siapharan ccaw kha ka pya hae. Siapharan nynh rhawbawi hae te marang rhawkaw hae kha ka kya a cciasah bua hae. <verse number="10" style="v" />Israel ccungccaw hae hoynaw kha ccungpya khylan ccungccaw lu kheit yn thua cipaw kha Horon ccungccaw Sanballat te Ammon ccungccaw bawi lu kheit Tobiah nynh he a thae hae tuh myaryamaw mih lunghoy khyh.</para>
  <para style="s1">Nehemiah nynh Khualungrua A Do</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tuhcite Jerusalem ka thua zah nin thum ka um. <verse number="12" style="v" />Ka kya um hae paw ccungccaw beihtaraw ryte khuazi khe kae thokuh; Jerusalem hanlan cyi lan ka Pachia nynh ka thinlung kya yn sangpaw kha tuh humhung mah ka hopah khyh. Ka ccikupaw sahiin laelan pawpaw sahiin mah ka kya um khyh. <verse number="13" style="v" />Khuazi khe Accya Koikua kyate ka pou zah Nakaa-hupi Tuisung po khung lang Athupaw Koikua kyacia ka cceih, te atingpaw Jerusalem khualungrua te maee nynh a ropaw a sakoih hae kha ka do hae. <verse number="14" style="v" />Te Tuidy Koikua te Siapharan Tuili kyacia po ka cceih; thuasalama ka ccikupaw sahiin hanlan po ccia nawlan laanpi um khyh. <verse number="15" style="v" />Tukeiccuze khuazi khe accya laanpi kyate ka cceihthung zah khualungrua kha ka do. Te nulang ka maeleihkuh zah Accya Koikua kyate ka tee zah ka ki. <verse number="16" style="v" />Teilangmou ka ccia cipaw te pawmou ka cyi cipaw kha bawi hae nynh nyh khyh hae; Judah hae, ranpibawi hae, cciakhaetu hae, bawi hae te tuhlaepaw ccungccaw hae kha ryalaw lanpaw ka hopah loh khyh hae.</para>
  <para style="s1">Khualungrua Raethui lan Byapaenaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Te kae nynh minmin kha, “Aening ah teing oh paw vawsawnaw, Jerusalem a ronaw te a koikua hae tuh maee nynh a upaw kha na muih oh. Aening nynh thethyanaw ah ccou vae khyh nawlan oh, rang oh, Jerusalem khualungrua kha raethui oh sih,” ka cipya hae. <verse number="18" style="v" />Ka Pachia thungnaw nynh ka tungvaw thawccinaw a hoipaw kha thuasah, siapharan nynh yn hopyapaw bya kha mah thuasah ka hopya hae. Tetuh minmin nynh, “Tho oh sih lah, sak oh sih!” a ci hae. Tuhcite rya hoypaw law khylan mih thawzung kha a pyaku hae. <verse number="19" style="v" />Thuasalama Horon ccungccaw Sanballat, Ammon ccungccaw bawi lu kheit Tobiah te Arab ccungccaw Geshum nynh tuh-e tuh a thae hae tuh, kaening kha nuinsete oun sarya hae zah, “E na cyi oh paw hynh pawmou athua? Siapharan tou na dou oh?” oun cipya hae. <verse number="20" style="v" />Kae nynh minmin kha, “Vaaw Pachia nynh laansui-uanaw oun pya cih zah, amaw ryalahtu hae kaening nynh kae tho cih zah kae sak cih; thuasalama nanning tuh Jerusalem khua kya ccoupaw nae kya-e thuasah, nae hanpaw thuasah, syntawnawpaw ccaekia thuasah na hoi khyh oh,” cite ka khung hae.</para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Ryalahtu Aphu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tetuh ranpibawi lupi Eliashib tuh a uno ranpibawi hae ryte thokuh hae zah Tuu Koikua kha a raethui hae; tuh-e tuh thyaasah hae zah a thuakaw hae kha a bing hae; te Azah Innhangpaw te Hananel Innhangpaw kyacia a raethui hae. <verse number="2" style="v" />Eliashib nynh a raethui koute Jeriko khuaccaaw hae nynh a raethui hae. Minmin koute Imri ccapaw Zakkur nynh a raethui.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Hassenaah ccapaw hae nynh Ngasaw Koikua kha a raethui hae; a thingccaw hae, a thuakaw hae, a thuakaw toh hae te a thuakaw ccong hae kha a bing hae. <verse number="4" style="v" />Te minmin koute Hakkoz ccapaw athuapaw Uriah a ccapaw Meremoth nynh a raethui. Tuh-e hae koute Meshezabel ccapaw athuapaw Berekhiah ccapaw Meshullam nynh a raethui. Minmin koute Baana ccapaw Zadok nynh a raethui. <verse number="5" style="v" />Te minmin koute Tekoa ccungccaw hae nynh a raethui hae; thuasalama mih bawi hae nynh mih Bawipaw rya kha lungngingte lah khyh hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Paseah ccapaw Joiada te Besodeiah ccapaw Meshullam nynh Koikua Rynpaw kha a raethui hae; a thingccaw hae, a thuakaw hae, a thuakaw toh hae te a thuakaw ccong hae kha a bing. <verse number="7" style="v" />Minmin koute Gibeon khuapaw Melatiah te Meronoth khuapaw Jadon, Vaw Khuraw lang ram a uktu uknaw lungkhu a um hae paw Gibeon ccungccaw hae te Mizpah ccungccaw hae nynh a raethui hae. <verse number="8" style="v" />Minmin koute Harhaiah ccapaw suilaeethyapaw Uzziel cikuhpaw nynh a raethui. Aning koute mynkhuhpaw a raethyapaw Hananiah nynh a raethui; minmin nynh Jerusalem kha Khualungrua Akopaw kyacia a raethui hae. <verse number="9" style="v" />Minmin koute Jerusalem pee angankuh a uktu Refaiah, Hur ccapaw nynh a raethui. <verse number="10" style="v" />Minmin koute Harumaf ccapaw Jedaiah nynh amaw inn te arawsekunaw kha a raethui; Jedaiah koute Hashabneiah ccapaw Hattush nynh a raethui. <verse number="11" style="v" />Harim ccapaw Malkhijah te Pahath-moab ccapaw Hasshub nynh ccangpaw hmin te Sanlou Ruanaw Innhangpaw kha a raethui hae. <verse number="12" style="v" />Aning koute Hallohesh ccapaw Shallum, Jerusalem pee angankuh a uktu te a ccanung hae nynh a raethui hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Hanun te Zanoah khuaccaaw hae nynh Accya Koikua kha a raethui hae; minmin nynh tuh-e tuh raethui hae zah a thuakaw hae, a thuakaw toh hae te a thuakaw ccong hae kha a bing hae, te khualungrua dong thong kheit kha Athupaw Koikua kyacia a raethui hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Rekhab ccapaw Malkhijah, Beth-hakkherem pee a uktu nynh Athupaw Koikua kha a raethui; aning nynh tuh-e tuh raethui zah a thuakaw hae, a thuakaw toh hae te a thuakaw ccong hae kha a bing.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Kolhozeh ccapaw Shallum, Mizpah pee a uktu nynh Tuidy Sakoih kha a raethui; aning nynh tuh-e tuh raethui zah a dawpah koute a thuakaw hae, a thuakaw toh hae te a thuakaw ccong hae kha a bing hae; aning nynh siapharan khokhu pe umpaw Shelah Tuili khualungrua kha David Khuapi kyate a cceihbungpaw nawkui hae kyacia a rae. <verse number="16" style="v" />Aning koute Azbuk ccapaw Nehemiah, Beth-zur pee angankuh a uktu nynh David shawku te arawsekunaw kyate tho zah raethuipaw tuili te rhawkaw hae inn kyacia a raethui. <verse number="17" style="v" />Aning koute Levi phin hae nynh a raethui hae: Bani ccapaw Rehum nynh raethui zah, aning koute Keilah pee angankuh a uktu Hashabiah nynh amaw pee hanlan a raethui. <verse number="18" style="v" />Aning koute a unopaw nynh a raethui: Aning tuh Henadad ccapaw Bavvai, Keilah pee angankuh uktu nynh thua; <verse number="19" style="v" />aning koute Jeshua ccapaw Ezer, Mizpah uktu nynh khua Apaki kya umpaw rhawtuk-zunghe nungnaw kalan akaethungpaw te arawsekunaw ccangpaw hmin kha a raethui. <verse number="20" style="v" />Aning koute Zabbai ccapaw Baruk nynh ccangpaw hmin kha khua Apaki kyate ranpibawi lupi Eliashib inn thuakaw kyacia a raethui. <verse number="21" style="v" />Aning koute Hakkoz ccapaw Uriah a ccapaw Meremoth nynh ccangpaw hmin kha Eliashib inn thuakaw kyate Eliashib inn athangnaw kyacia a raethui. <verse number="22" style="v" />Aning koute Jerusalem pepan umpaw ranpibawi hae nynh a raethui hae. <verse number="23" style="v" />Minmin koute Benjamin te Hasshub nynh mih inn te arawsekunaw kha a raethui hae. Minmin koute Ananiah ccapaw athuapaw Maaseiah a ccapaw Azariah nynh amaw inn pe kha a raethui. <verse number="24" style="v" />Aning koute Henadad ccapaw Binnui nynh ccangpaw hmin kha Azariah inn kyate khua akouleihnaw Apaki kyacia a raethui. <verse number="25" style="v" />Uzai ccapaw Palal nynh khua Apaki te arawsekunaw kha thuasah, rhawviatu hae umnaw pe umpaw siapharan inn palung lang e innhangpaw kha thuasah a raethui. Aning koute Parosh ccapaw Pedaiah te <verse number="26" style="v" />Ofel kya um hae paw beikinn ryalahtu hae nynh nithua lang e Tui Koikua te arawsekunaw hmin kyate innhangpaw kyacia a raethui. <verse number="27" style="v" />Aning koute Tekoa khuaccaaw hae nynh myarya lepaw innhangpaw te arawsekunaw ccangpaw hmin kha Ofel lungrua kyacia a raethui hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Ranpibawi hae nynh Marang Sakoih palung lang, mimaw inn raveihte arawsekunaw kha a raethui hae. <verse number="29" style="v" />Minmin koute Immer ccapaw Zadok nynh amaw inn te arawsekunaw kha a raethui. Aning koute Shekaniah ccapaw Shemaiah, Nithua Sakoih a ngawtu nynh a raethui. <verse number="30" style="v" />Aning koute Shelemiah ccapaw Hananiah te Zalaf ccapaw lu taruhnaw Hanun nynh ccangpaw hmin kha a raethui hae. Minmin koute Berekhiah ccapaw Meshullam nynh amaw a umnaw inn te arawsekunaw kha a raethui. <verse number="31" style="v" />Aning koute suilaeetu Malkhijah nynh beikinn ryalahtu hae inn te kungkutu hae inn kyacia thuasah, Bawi Sakoih te arawsekunaw, lungrua apaki kya umpaw palung khaan kyacia thuasah a raethui. <verse number="32" style="v" />Lungrua apaki kya umpaw palung khaan te Tuu Koikua laku kha suilaeetu hae te kungku hae nynh a raethui hae.</para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Rawsetu hae nynh Ro lan Paccynkunaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Kaening nynh khualungrua kae raepaw kha Sanballat nynh he a thae tuh, myaryamaw a thinria zah Judah hae kha a sarya hae. <verse number="2" style="v" />A uno hae te Samaria rhawkaw hae malang khe aning nynh, “E athawzyapaw Judah hae hynh pawmou a cyi hae? Uccaw hynh a raekuh thui cih hae tou? Silawnaw a rae cih hae tou? Nin kheit te a lyn cih hae tou? Maee nynh a upaw lung hae kha athupaw apumkuhpaw lungkhu kyate a raethui cih hae tou?” a ci. <verse number="3" style="v" />Ammon ccungccaw Tobiah tuh a pe khe um zah aning nynh mah, “Minmin nynh a rae hae paw lungrua vawlan khe suizaw nynh a kaenaw ze ating cih!” a ci. <verse number="4" style="v" />Pou kae Pachia, kaening hynh oun theihrya hae keiccuze beih oun thaepya tua; mih saryanaw bya kha mimaw lu vawlan ccawsah tua, te kyng hae zah a cciakhaenaw hae ram kyakhe luadenaw a teingpaw ccungccaw lang tang sah hae. <verse number="5" style="v" />Mih cyiseinaw kha bongpah nan hae lah, mih seinaw kha na muihnaw kyate thepah nan hae; pawccecize minmin nynh khualungrua a raetu hae malang saryanaw bya a ho hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tuhcite khualungrua kha kae rae zah, ahangpaw angankuh cia po lekuh lan rae athua vae; pawccecize ccungccaw hae tuh ryalaw rynaw thinlung a hoi hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Thuasalama Jerusalem khualungrua raethuinaw rya tuh dyadya cceihthya zah a uanaw hmin hae tuh a ping takaw vae hae cipaw kha Sanballat, Tobiah, Arab hae, Ammon hae te Ashdod ccungccaw hae nynh he a thae hae tuh, myarya mih thinria zah, <verse number="8" style="v" />Jerusalem kha ccianuate tuk lan zah vawsawnaw pya lan cite mih balyn te pynkheihlan khua a khanku hae. <verse number="9" style="v" />Tukeiccuze kae Pachia kalan saw kae sang zah, minmin kyate oun thungkhawtu lang rhawviatu kha khuazi khuadae kae nung.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Thuasalama Judah hae nynh, “Phupaw phutu hae tuh mih thawzung athang vae, athupaw tuh myaryamaw lung zah khualungrua phe thang lan ryalaw kho lei lan,” a ci hae. <verse number="11" style="v" />Te kae rhaw hae nynh mah, “Minmin nynh pawpaw mah a ny maw hae te a muih maw hae khe, ccianua lan hae zah chia lan hae, te ryalaw kha ro lan,” a ci hae. <verse number="12" style="v" />Rhaw hae pe a umpaw Judah hae nynh oun cceih hae zah kae kyakhe, “Rhaw hae nynh mih umnaw miakaw kyate tuk lan oun ccianua cih hae,” cite vae haw oun hopya hae. <verse number="13" style="v" />Tukeiccuze khualungrua nulang, anenaw hmin, accawnghannaw hmin kyakhe ccungccaw hae kha mih puizia raveihte, mih thaloi, mih ccoi te mih li hae ryte ka nung hae. <verse number="14" style="v" />E hae balyn kha ka dopah kou hae te, ka thadyn zah cciakhaetu hae, bawi hae te tuhlaepaw ccungccaw hae kyakhe, “Minmin kha rih nan oh. Alesaepaw te ri lan umpaw <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kha ning nan oh lah, nae vaeccaw hae, nae ccapaw hae, nae ccanung hae, nae zu hae te nae inn nae loo hanlan rhawtuk oh,” ka cipya hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Mih paccynkunaw kha Pachia nynh roh zah kaening nynh kae ny vae cipaw kha kae rhaw hae nynh he a nyh hae tuh, kae balyn mawte khualungrua kalan kae ki zah mawmaw rya raveih kha bua kae lah. <verse number="16" style="v" />Tuin nin te vae tuh, ka ccungccaw hae angankuh tuh ryalah hae zah, angankuh tuh ccoi, khawriaphua, li te sivaw angki kha a ccyngku hae; cciakhaetu hae tuh khualungrua a rae hae paw Judah hae nulang khe a um hae. <verse number="17" style="v" />Phupaw phutu hae nynh mih kuih voikheit te mih uccaw kha kyng hae zah ccangpaw voikheit te mih zunghe kha a kyng hae. <verse number="18" style="v" />Ryalahtu hae balyn nynh rya a lah lalia lan hae te mih tae kyakhe mih thaloi kha ccarou a keku hae. Mungkae a tupaw tuh ka pe khe a um. <verse number="19" style="v" />Kae nynh cciakhaetu hae, bawi hae te tuhlaepaw ccungccaw hae kha, “Rya tuh myarya le zah myarya ko lan apazaekuh, aening mah khualungrua vawlan khe ah phiakuh oh zah lu kheit te lu kheit ah sawkuh oh. <verse number="20" style="v" />Tukeiccuze mungkae roi na thaenaw oh hmin takyh kyate kae kalan nae pumkuh cih oh. Ah Pachia nynh aening hanlan rhaw oun tukpah cih,” ka cipya hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tuhcite rya kae lah zah ccungccaw angankuh nynh khuadaetakaw te awsi phe alang cia ccoi a ccyngku hae. <verse number="22" style="v" />Tuh ccyh lyakhe kae nynh mah ccungccaw hae kha, “Ccungccaw miakaw nynh a ryalahtupaw ryte Jerusalem khua kya khuazi a rya cih, tuhteze nynh minmin tuh khuazi kya aening elang rhawviatu athua cih hae zah khuadae kya rya a lah cih hae,” cite ka hopya hae. <verse number="23" style="v" />Tuhcite kamaw thuasah, ka uno hae thuasah, ka ryalahtu hae thuasah, kae yn zui hae paw rhawviatu hae thuasah boeining kae khahkuh khyh; lu raveih nynh zunghe kha ranglang kuih kya tyty kae ccyngku.</para>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Nehemiah te Tuaasahnaw Teingtu hae</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Te ccungccaw hae tuh mih zu hae ryte mih uno Judah hae kha rawsete thawte a sia hae. <verse number="2" style="v" />Ccungccaw abang nynh, “Kae ccanung hae kae ccapaw hae ryte ccungccaw kae lung; looh kae ae zah kae hiin nawlan looh kae mue hahe aho,” a ci hae. <verse number="3" style="v" />Abang nynh, “Kae loo, kae khokhu te kae inn hae kha ccakancci lungkhu looh mue nawlan kae pon vae,” a ci hae. <verse number="4" style="v" />Abang nynh, “Kae loo hae te kae misu khokhu hae hanlan siapharan kalan ngunto pya khylan phua kae koii hae. <verse number="5" style="v" />Atu tuh kae pyn tuh kae uno hae pyn hawte nynh kae thua vae; kae ccaaw hae tuh mih ccaaw hae hawte nynh thua vae hae; kae ccapaw hae te kae ccanung hae kha see lang tang lan kae nangse vae hae, kae ccanung hae abang tuh see lang zua athua vae hae; kaening tuh thawzung kae hoi vae khyh zah kae loo hae te kae misu khokhu hae tuh milae uccaw lang nynh a tang vae,” a ci hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Mih siaruanaw te tuh-e mih lungccing leinaw bya hae tuh he ka thae te, myarya ka thinria. <verse number="7" style="v" />Tuh-e tuh hoyte ka tua koute, cciakhaetu hae te bawi hae kha seisahnaw bya ka hopah hae zah, “Nanning nynh naemaw ccungccaw hae kya-e ato kha na ae oh,” ka cipya hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5.7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 22:25">Exo 22.25</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 25:35-37">Lev 25.35-37</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 23:19-20">Deu 23.19-20</ref></char></note> Te minmin ryte bya hopiaku khylan ccungccaw zapi patae kha ka ko hae zah, <verse number="8" style="v" />“Minphuin ccangpaw hae kalan zua athuapaw ah uno Judah hae kha aening nynh ah taening oh thyhte ah kikhae oh; thuasalama nanning nynh nae uno hae kha na zua oh zah, kaening nynh bua kae rethui hae aho cih!” ka cipya hae. Minmin tuh ho lanpaw bya kaw kheit san nykuh vae khyh hae zah daebabi lan a um hae. <verse number="9" style="v" />Tukeiccuze kae nynh, “Na cyi oh paw hynh hoy khyh. Ah rhaw hae minphuin ccangpaw hae nynh aening hynh oun sarya khyh nawlan hae, ah Pachia rawrite na hiin lan oh ccan khyh tou? <verse number="10" style="v" />Tuhpiaze kae te ka uno hae te ka ryalahtu hae nynh minmin kha phua te looh kae koiisaku hae. E ato lawkupaw hynh umtaw ccavae oh sih. <verse number="11" style="v" />Atunin ccaccei maw, mih loo, mih misu khokhu, mih oliv khokhu, mih inn, phua ato na law oh paw, looh, misutui te chitui, minmin kya-e na law oh paw kha mimaw kalan kii oh,” ka cipya hae. <verse number="12" style="v" />Tetuh minmin nynh, “Abalynte kae kii cih hae zah minmin kyate pawpaw mah kae ngia vae lan khyh hae. Na ho hawte kae cyih cih,” a ci hae. Te ranpibawi hae kha ka ko hae zah, tuh-e hae nynh bya a kinku hae hawte a cyi nawlan hae, thyalawkunaw ka raesah hae. <verse number="13" style="v" />Kae nynh mah ka tae kya ka voikupaw boeining kha ka thyng zah, “E byakinkunaw a zui leipaw miakaw tuh inn kyate thuasah, sisua kyate thuasah hynhcite Pachia nynh thyng vae sah. Minmin tuh hynhcite thyng thua hae sah lah, accakaepaw lang cciataw thua hae sah,” ka ci. Te ccungccaw zapi balyn nynh, “Amen,” ci hae zah <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kha thehoysah hae. Te ccungccaw hae nynh bya a kinku hae hawte a cyi hae.</para>
  <para style="s1">Karankunaw Hoi leipaw Nehemiah</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tuhpiaze Judah ram a uktu lang khang ka thua ccyh kyate, Artazaksis Siapharan nynh siapharan lang a tangnaw kum kuinnaw te sung thum kum ningnaw cia, kum haw lae ning lungkhu, kae te ka uno hae tuh uktu bawi looh kha kae ae khyh. <verse number="15" style="v" />Kae ka maw e uktu rynpaw hae nynh ccungccaw hae kha phupaw ripaw phusah hae zah, minmin kyate ngun shekel sung pali apiaze looh te misutui kha a lawku hae. Mih ryalahtu hae nynh heize ccungccaw hae tungvaw phupaw a risah hae. Thuasalama kae tuh Pachia raw ka ri keiccuze tuhte ka cyih khyh. <verse number="16" style="v" />E khualungrua rya kyahin kamaw te kamaw ka pyakuh zah ka lawkupaw laephi um khyh; ka ryalahtu balyn tuh khuing kya ryalaw lan a sueluakuh hae. <verse number="17" style="v" />Tuhpiaze ah pepan e minphuin hae kyate ah kalan oun thua hae paw kha hobia leite, Judah hae te bawi hae za kheit sung pangaw tuh ka ccaboi kya tyty a ae hae. <verse number="18" style="v" />Nin kheit hanlan tangnuapaw sa kheit te popaw tuu sa taruh kha a paccyn hae; aw hae kha mah ka hanlan yn paccynpya hae; nin haw ze vae kheit misutui kha saving tui-ung te patae yn pya hae; tuhzemah ccungccaw hae tuh mih phupaw ari keiccuze uktu bawi nynh a lawku lanpaw looh kha ka lawkuh khyh. <verse number="19" style="v" />Pou ka Pachia, e ccungccaw hae hanlan ka cyipaw balyn hynh ka hoynaw elang beih yn ningpah nan.</para>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Rhaw hae Thyaruhnaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Khualungrua kha ka rae kou vae zah a uanaw um vae khyh cipaw kha Sanballat, Tobiah, Arab ccungccaw Geshem te tuhlaepaw kae rhaw hae nynh he a thae hae tuh (tuin ccyh kyacia koikua hae kya thuakaw hae kha ka bing loh khyh zemah), <verse number="2" style="v" />Sanballat te Geshem nynh ka kalan ccungccaw oun saw hae zah, “Yn cceih lah Ono bialae e khua khuakheit kya tungku tua oh sih,” yn cipya hae. Thuasalama minmin nynh kae kha vawsaw pya lan oun nounuaku hae. <verse number="3" style="v" />Tukeiccuze minmin kalan locceihtu hae ka saw hae zah, “Kae tuh myarya lepaw rya kha ka lah cciamang zah kae cceihbung lan khyh. Nanning kalan cciabung khylan pawccemou rya kha ka cciataw cih zah ka um cih?” ka cipya hae. <verse number="4" style="v" />Tuhcite vae pali cia bya yn taw hae zah, kae nynh mah tuhmaminte ka khungru hae. <verse number="5" style="v" />Tuhmaminte vae pangawnaw kya Sanballat nynh a ryalahtupaw kha yn saw zah tazeih khiakuh leipaw ccaw kha ka kalan yn pyasah. <verse number="6" style="v" />Ccaw lungkhu khe, “Nang te Judah hae tuh rhawtho lan na paccynkuh oh cite minphuin hae laku kya bya athan, Geshem nynh mah a ho; tukeiccu nynh khualungrua hynh na rae oh; tuh-e bya thyhte nang tuh mih siapharan lang tang na ry. <verse number="7" style="v" />‘Judah ram kya siapharan a um!’ cite na konglang Jerusalem kya a siakhae lanpaw profeh hae kha mah na nung vae hae. Atu tuh e bya hae thyhte siapharan kha thaesah athua cih. Tukeiccuze yn cceih lah, la hokheih tua oh sih,” a cipya. <verse number="8" style="v" />Tetuh kae nynh a kalan ccungccaw ka saw zah, “Nang nynh na ho hawte ryalawpaw pawpaw mah um khyh; namaw na tuanaw te tuh-e hae tuh na raekupaw nynh thua,” ka cipya. <verse number="9" style="v" />Pawccecize minmin nynh kaening kha mih thawsia sah ci ry hae zah, “Ryalaw kha umtaw hae sah lah, rya kha lyn nan hae sah,” cite a tua hae. Thuasalama pou Pachia, ka kuih hynh thawzung pyatua.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Nin kheit tuh Mehetabel ccapaw athuapaw Delaiah a ccapaw Shemaiah, a inn kyate a pou kho leipaw ccungccapaw inn lang he ka cceih tuh, aning nynh, “Pachia inn, beikinn lungkhu kya tungku tua sih lah, beikinn thuakaw hae kha khaw sih, pawccecize nang kha chia khylan oun cceih cih hae, atu khuazi nang kha chia khylan solei oun cceih cih hae,” yn cipya. <verse number="11" style="v" />Thuasalama kae nynh, “Kae tahawpaw ccungccaw nynh a ccue cih zawtou? Kae tahawpaw ccungccaw nynh a hiinnaw khyn khylan beikinn lungkhu lang a tee cih zawtou? Ka tee lan khyh!” ka ci. <verse number="12" style="v" />Pachia nynh aning kha yn sawpaw thua leite, Tobiah te Sanballat nynh amee pyate a hoh hae keiccuze kae kha rawsenawpaw bya a ho cipaw ka nyh zah ka muih. <verse number="13" style="v" />Minmin nynh kae kha theihryapaw lang a tang ccaw cite, kae kha siisakute tuhcite cyi liate seinaw rae sah lah, a minthu sah cite tuh-e paw tuh a hoh hae. <verse number="14" style="v" />Pou ka Pachia, Tobiah te Sanballat hynh a cyi hae paw e uccaw hae thyhte syntaw hae lah, profehnung Noadiah te kae oun risah ry hae paw tuhlaepaw profeh hae kha mah syntawtua hae.</para>
  <para style="s1">Khualungrua Lynnaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Khualungrua tuh sung pangaw nin ning aro te, Elul sawpaw nin kuin lae pangaw nin khe lyn athua. <verse number="16" style="v" />Kae rhaw hae balyn nynh tuh-e tuh he a thae hae te, kae pepan e minphuin hae balyn tuh rih hae zah mimaw te mimaw a zynkunaw hae kha myarya azyabung; pawccecize e rya tuh kae Pachia bawmnaw liate lyn athua vae cipaw kha a ny hae. <verse number="17" style="v" />Tuhpiaze tuh ccyh lya tuh Judah cciakhaetu hae nynh Tobiah kha ccaw patae ky hae zah Tobiah ccaw mah minmin kya a thua. <verse number="18" style="v" />Tobiah tuh Arah ccapaw Shekaniah ccanung a vawpaw athua keiccuze Judah hae patae tuh Tobiah kalan byakinkute a pan hae: a ccapaw Jehohanan nynh Berekhiah ccapaw Meshullam ccanung kha zu lang a hoi. <verse number="19" style="v" />Tobiah nynh hoynaw a raepaw kong kha mah minmin nynh yn honua hae zah, ka bya kha amaw kalan a thaesah hae. Te Tobiah nynh kae kha a thawsia sah cite ccaw yn ky.</para>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Khualungrua kha kae lyn zah thuakaw hae kha kae bing koute sakoih ngawtu hae, hlawsahtu hae te Levi phin hae kha rya kae khang kou hae te, <verse number="2" style="v" />ka neitaw Hanani te rhawlungrua koihkuhpaw inn uktu rhawbawipaw Hananiah kha Jerusalem khua do-oihpaw rya ka pya hae, pawccecize Hananiah tuh ccungccaw patae laeze a lungzi huapaw te Pachia rawrih huapaw nynh thua. <verse number="3" style="v" />Kae nynh minmin kha, “Khuanin aso maw tuh Jerusalem koikua hae kha hung lei lan; thuakaw ngawtu hae a um lya hae tuh thuakaw hae kha khaw hae sah lah, tou hae sah. Jerusalem khuaccaaw hae laku e kha rhawviatu hae na khang cih oh, ccungccaw abang tuh mimaw mih ngawnaw hmin kya, ccangpaw hae tuh mimaw inn malang kya a ngaw cih hae,” ka cipya hae. <verse number="4" style="v" />Khua tuh ko zah ale, thuasalama khua lungkhu e ccungccaw hae tuh zya hae zah inn hae tuh sak loh khyh hae.</para>
  <para style="s1">A Ki hae paw Ccazing</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="EZR 2:1-70">Ezr 2.1-70</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Te cciakhaetu hae, bawi hae te ccungccaw hae kha mih thokeinaw thyhte ccazing law khylan pum lan hae ka Pachia nynh ka thinlung kya yn sang. Te masaty a ki hae paw mih thokeinaw ccauh kha ka muih zah a lungkhu kya akawlan thyhte azeikuhpaw kha ka muih:</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Babilon Siapharan Nebukhadnezzar nynh kyng hae zah a cciakhae hae paw, a kyng hae paw ccungccaw hae kyate a pou hae paw ram kya-e ccungccaw hae tuh e hae nynh thua; minmin tuh Jerusalem te Judah ram langkhe mimaw khua raveih lang a ki hae. <verse number="7" style="v" />Minmin tuh Zerubbabel, Jeshua, Nehemiah, Azariah, Raamiah, Nahamani, Mordekai, Bilshan, Mispereth, Bigvai, Nehum, Baanah ryte a ki hae.</para>
  <para style="p">Israel ccungccaw hae milu tuh: <verse number="8" style="v" />Parosh ciihan hae tuh thong ning za kheit sung sari lu ning, <verse number="9" style="v" />Shefatiah ciihan hae tuh za thum sung sari lu ning, <verse number="10" style="v" />Arah ciihan hae tuh za taruh sung pangaw lu ning, <verse number="11" style="v" />Pahath-moab ciihan hae lungkhu e Jeshua te Joab ciihan hae tuh thong ning za tarya lu haw lae tarya, <verse number="12" style="v" />Elam ciihan hae tuh thong kheit za ning sung pangaw lu pali, <verse number="13" style="v" />Zattu ciihan hae tuh za tarya sung pali lu pangaw, <verse number="14" style="v" />Zakkai ciihan hae tuh za sari sung taruh, <verse number="15" style="v" />Binnui ciihan hae tuh za taruh sung pali lu tarya, <verse number="16" style="v" />Bebai ciihan hae tuh za taruh lu kuin lae tarya, <verse number="17" style="v" />Azgad ciihan hae tuh thong ning za thum lu kuin lae ning, <verse number="18" style="v" />Adonikam ciihan hae tuh za taruh sung taruh lu sari, <verse number="19" style="v" />Bigvai ciihan hae tuh thong ning sung taruh lu sari, <verse number="20" style="v" />Adin ciihan hae tuh za taruh sung pangaw lu pangaw, <verse number="21" style="v" />Ater ciihan hae lungkhu e Hezekiah ciihan hae tuh sung takua lu tarya, <verse number="22" style="v" />Hashum ciihan hae tuh za thum lu kuin lae tarya. <verse number="23" style="v" />Bezai ciihan hae tuh za thum lu kuin lae pali. <verse number="24" style="v" />Harif ciihan hae tuh za kheit lu haw lae ning, <verse number="25" style="v" />Gibeon ciihan hae tuh sung takua lu pangaw. <verse number="26" style="v" />Bethlehem te Netofah khuaccaaw hae tuh za kheit sung tarya lu tarya. <verse number="27" style="v" />Anathoth khuaccaaw hae tuh za kheit lu kuin lae tarya, <verse number="28" style="v" />Beth-azmaveth khuaccaaw hae tuh sung pali lu ning, <verse number="29" style="v" />Kiriath-jearim, Khefirah Beeroth ciihan hae tuh za sari sung pali lu thum. <verse number="30" style="v" />Ramah te Geba ciihan hae tuh za taruh lu kuin lae kheit. <verse number="31" style="v" />Mikmash khuaccaaw hae tuh za kheit lu kuin lae ning. <verse number="32" style="v" />Bethel te Ai khuaccaaw hae tuh za kheit lu kuin lae thum. <verse number="33" style="v" />Ccangpaw Nebo ciihan hae tuh sung pangaw lu ning. <verse number="34" style="v" />Ccangpaw Elam ciihan hae tuh thong kheit za ning sung pangaw lu pali. <verse number="35" style="v" />Harim ciihan hae tuh za thum lu kuin. <verse number="36" style="v" />Jeriko ciihan hae tuh za thum sung pali lu pangaw. <verse number="37" style="v" />Lod, Hadid te Ono ciihan hae tuh za sari lu kuin lae kheit. <verse number="38" style="v" />Senaah ciihan hae tuh thong thum za takua sung thum acih hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Ranpibawi hae tuh: Jeshua puizia hae Jedaiah ciihan hae tuh za takua sung sari lu thum. <verse number="40" style="v" />Immer ciihan hae tuh thong kheit sung pangaw lu ning. <verse number="41" style="v" />Pashhur ciihan hae tuh thong kheit za ning sung pali lu sari, <verse number="42" style="v" />Harim ciihan hae tuh thong kheit lu haw lae sari acih hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Levi phin hae tuh: Hodaviah ciihan hae Jeshua te Kadmiel mih ciihan hae tuh sung sari lu pali acih hae. <verse number="44" style="v" />Hlawsahthya hae paw tuh: Asaf ciihan hae za kheit sung pali lu tarya acih hae. <verse number="45" style="v" />Sakoih ngawtu hae tuh: Shallum ciihan hae, Ater ciihan hae, Talmon ciihan hae, Akkub ciihan hae, Hatita ciihan hae te Shobai ciihan hae mih balynte za kheit sung thum lu tarya acih hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Beikinn ryalahtu hae tuh: Ziha ciihan hae, Hasufa ciihan hae, Tabbaoth ciihan hae, <verse number="47" style="v" />Keros ciihan hae, Sia ciihan hae, Padon ciihan hae, <verse number="48" style="v" />Lebana ciihan hae, Hagaba ciihan hae, Shalmai ciihan hae, <verse number="49" style="v" />Hanan ciihan hae, Giddel ciihan hae, Gahar ciihan hae, <verse number="50" style="v" />Reaiah ciihan hae, Rezin ciihan hae, Nekoda ciihan hae, <verse number="51" style="v" />Gazzam ciihan hae, Uzza ciihan hae, Paseah ciihan hae, <verse number="52" style="v" />Besai ciihan hae, Meunim ciihan hae, Nefushesim ciihan hae, <verse number="53" style="v" />Bakbuk ciihan hae, Hakufa ciihan hae, Harhur ciihan hae, <verse number="54" style="v" />Bazlith ciihan hae, Mehida ciihan hae, Harsha ciihan hae, <verse number="55" style="v" />Barkos ciihan hae, Sisera ciihan hae, Temah ciihan hae, <verse number="56" style="v" />Neziah ciihan hae te Hatifa ciihan hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" />Solomon a ryalahtu hae ciihan hae tuh: Sotai ciihan hae, Sofereth ciihan hae, Perida ciihan hae, <verse number="58" style="v" />Jaala ciihan hae, Darkon ciihan hae, Giddel ciihan hae, <verse number="59" style="v" />Shefatiah ciihan hae, Hattil ciihan hae, Pokhereth-hazzebaim ciihan hae te Amon ciihan hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" />Beikinn ryalahtu hae balyn te Solomon a ryalahtu hae ciihan hae tuh za thum sung takua lu ning acih hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v" />Akawlan e hae tuh Tel-melah, Tel-harsha, Kherub, Addan te Immer khua hae kyate a cceihthung hae paw nynh thua, thuasalama minmin tuh mih puizia hae thuasah, mih thokeinaw thuasah, Israel hae athua hae thua khyh hae cipaw thuasah ccaekia langsakuh kho khyh hae: <verse number="62" style="v" />Delaiah ciihan hae, Tobiah ciihan hae te Nekoda ciihan hae, za taruh sung pali lu ning acih hae. <verse number="63" style="v" />Ranpibawi hae tuh: Habaiah ciihan hae, Hakkoz ciihan hae te Barzillai ciihan hae (Barzillai tuh Gilead ccungccaw Barzillai ccanung lu kheit kha zu lang a la dyku keiccuze Barzillai ciihan cite ko athua hae). <verse number="64" style="v" />E hae nynh thokeinaw ccauh kya mih min ccazing kha a ccung hae zemah muih khyh hae, tukeiccuze minmin tuh thyaa khyh hae cite ranpibawi thuanaw kyate a vua hae; <verse number="65" style="v" />Urim te Thummim khate ryalahpaw ranpibawi a um makhia tuh athyaa huaccepaw looh kha na ae lan khyh oh cite uktu bawi nynh minmin kha a hopya hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7.65: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 28:30">Exo 28.30</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 33:8">Deu 33.8</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" />Ccungccaw zapi hae tuh mih balynte sung pali thong ning za thum sung taruh acih hae, <verse number="67" style="v" />tuhpiaze mih seepaw hae te mih seenung hae tuh thong sari za thum sung thum lu sari a um hae; hlawsahthya hae paw nopi pise za ning sung pali lu pangaw a hoi hae. <verse number="68" style="v" />Minmin nynh marang za sari sung thum sa taruh, lann dihpaw za ning sung pali sa pangaw, <verse number="69" style="v" />kalauh za pali sung thum sa pangaw te lann thong taruh za sari sa kuin a hoi hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="70" style="v" />Puizia hae kya-e lu hae abang nynh ryalawnaw hanlan a hlu hae. Ram uktu bawi nynh sui darik thong kheit, pakekhupaw sung pangaw te ranpibawi angkiccua za pangaw sung thum kha sisuakhaan kalan a pya. <verse number="71" style="v" />Te puizia kya-e lu hae abang nynh sui darik thong kuin te ngun mina thong ning za ning kha inn sak nawlan a pya hae. <verse number="72" style="v" />Tuhlaepaw ccungccaw hae nynh a pya hae paw tuh sui darik thong kuin, ngun mina thong ning te ranpibawi angkiccua sung taruh zung sari nynh thua.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="73" style="v" />Tuhcite ranpibawi hae, Levi phin hae, sakoih ngawtu hae, hlawsahthya hae paw, ccungccaw abang, beikinn ryalahtu hae te Israel hae balyn tuh mimaw khua raveih kya a um hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7.73: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CH 9:2">1Sh 9.2</ref>; <ref loc="NEH 11:3">Neh 11.3</ref></char></note></para>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Ezra nynh Kawbya Zui lan A Hopya hae</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Sawpaw sah sarinaw he yn thua zah Israel ccungccaw hae tuh mimaw khua raveih kya he a um hae te, ccungccaw hae balyn tuh Tui Koikua malang accawnghannaw hmin khe a pumkuh hae. <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh Israel a pyapaw Moses kawbya ccauh kha yn ccyng cite kawbya sazae Ezra kha a hopya hae. <verse number="2" style="v" />Ranpibawi Ezra nynh kawbya tuh thae kho zah a thaethyapaw balyn, nopi pise ccungccaw zapi malang khe sawpaw sah sarinaw nin kheit nin kya a thuakhae. <verse number="3" style="v" />Ezra nynh tuh-e ccauh tuh awkhua takaw te ninthu cia Tui Koikua malang accawnghannaw hmin kalan hawi zah, a thaethya khopaw nopi pise malang khe a ria; ccungccaw balyn nynh kawbya ccauh tuh pekite a ngae hae. <verse number="4" style="v" />Byaho nawlan a rae hae paw thing aduakuhpaw vawlan khe Ezra tuh thadyn zah amaw pe a ranglang khe Mattithiah, Shema, Anaiah, Uriah, Hilkiah te Maaseiah tuh a thadyn hae; a voilang khe Pedaiah, Mishael, Malkhijah, Hashum, Hashbaddanah, Zekhariah te Meshullam tuh a thadyn hae. <verse number="5" style="v" />Te Ezra nynh ccauh tuh ccungccaw balyn muihnaw khe a kia, aning tuh ccungccaw balyn laeze ahangnaw khe a thadyn; ccauh he a kia te, ccungccaw balyn tuh a thadyn hae. <verse number="6" style="v" />Ezra nynh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char>, alesaepaw Pachia kha a thehoysah, te ccungccaw balyn nynh mih kuih hang hae zah, “Amen, Amen,” a ci hae. Te mih lu bakhung hae zah laekhu kya bakhungte <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kha a beik hae. <verse number="7" style="v" />Ccungccaw hae tuh mih umnaw kya a um lya hae khe Levi phin hae Jeshua, Bani, Sherebiah, Jamin, Akkub, Shabbethai, Hodiah, Maaseiah, Kelita, Azariah, Jozabad, Hanan te Pelaiah nynh mah ccungccaw hae nynh kawbya a thaethya nawlan hae a bawm hae. <verse number="8" style="v" />Tuhcite Pachia kawbya ccauh kha byaleih biate a ria hae. Ccungccaw hae nynh a ria hae paw kha a thaethya nawlan hae asuilan a ccaesahpya hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ram uktu Nehemiah, ranpibawi te kawbya sazae athuapaw Ezra te ccungccaw hae a ccangpahtu Levi phin hae nynh ccungccaw hae kha, “Atunin hynh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nae Pachia hanlan nin thyaapaw nynh thua; nae ngaethah nan sah, raw mah rah nan oh,” a cipya hae. Pawccecize ccungccaw balyn tuh kawbya kya-e bya kha he a thae hae tuh a rah hae. <verse number="10" style="v" />Te aning nynh minmin kha, “La cceih oh, looh athuathuapaw kha la ae oh lah, misutui a-epaw kha la neih oh, te pawpaw mah a hoi lei hae paw kha la neethungbua oh; pawccecize atunin tuh ah <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> hanlan athyaapaw nin nynh thua; <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kya nae lungtuanaw tuh nae thawzung athua keiccuze nae ngaethah nan sah,” a cipya hae. <verse number="11" style="v" />Tukeiccuze Levi phin hae nynh ccungccaw balyn kha daesah hae zah, “Atunin tuh athyaapaw nin athua keiccuze daebabi lan umtua oh; nae ngaethah nan sah,” a cipya hae. <verse number="12" style="v" />Te ccungccaw balyn nynh a hopya hae paw bya kha a thaethya hae keiccuze ae khylan, nia khylan, milae hae kha neethungbua khylan te lungpawnaw pipi rae khylan a cceih hae.</para>
  <para style="s1">Bu Poi A Tua hae</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Nin ningnaw nin khe ccungccaw balyn laku e puizia raveih kya-e lupi hae tuh ranpibawi hae te Levi phin hae ryte kawbya kya-e bya hae kha ccangku khylan kawbya sazae Ezra kalan a cceihkheih hae. <verse number="14" style="v" />Sawpaw sah sarinaw poi tua lungkhu Israel hae tuh bu kya a um cih hae, cite <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh Moses kyate kaw a pya hae paw kawbya lungkhu kya azeikuhpaw kha a muih hae,<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8.14-15: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 23:33-36">Lev 23.33-36</ref>, <ref loc="LEV 23:39-43">39-43</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 16:13-15">Deu 16.13-15</ref></char></note> <verse number="15" style="v" />mih khua hae balyn kya te Jerusalem khua kyakhe, “Mua hae kalan cceih oh lah, oliv nge hae, maeccaw nge hae, martal thing ange hae, ungcci ku ange hae te ccangpaw anaw saepaw thing hae kha kawbya kya azeiku thyhte bu sak nawlan oun thuakhae oh,” cite a thaesah hae. <verse number="16" style="v" />Tukeiccuze ccungccaw hae tuh cceih hae zah thingnge hae kha oun thuakhae hae zah, mih innccuvaw kya thuasah, mih inn voidu te Pachia inn voidu lungkhu thuasah, Tui Koikua kya accawnghannaw kya thuasah, Efraim Koikua accawnghannaw kya thuasah bu kha ccarou a sakku hae. <verse number="17" style="v" />Seetangnaw kyate a ki hae paw a pumkuh hae paw zapi balyn nynh bu sakkuh hae zah tuin kya a um hae; Nun ccapaw Jeshua she kyate tuin nin cia Israel ccungccaw hae nynh tuhte la cyih boi khyh hae. Myaryamaw mih lungpaw. <verse number="18" style="v" />Masaty nin kyate nyathya nin kyacia nin takyhte Pachia kawbya ccauh kya-e kha a ria. Nin sari lungkhu poi a tua hae; nin taryanaw nin khe phungzae thyhte athyaapaw pumkunaw a hoi hae.</para>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Ccungccaw hae Sei Phykunaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />E sawpaw nin kuin lae pali nin khe Israel hae tuh looh-aesungte buriboei lawkuh hae zah mih lu vawlan vuiping phingkute a pumkuh hae. <verse number="2" style="v" />Israel ccungccaw hae tuh ramccang hae balyn kyate mimaw ccangte thadyn hae zah mih seinaw te mih minpaaw hae hoyleinaw kha a phyku hae. <verse number="3" style="v" />Mimaw umnaw kya thadyn hae zah <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> mih Pachia kawbya ccauh kya-e kha nin pum pali pum kheit lungkhu a ria hae, ccangpaw pum pali pum kheit lungkhu kya mih seinaw phykuh hae zah <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> mih Pachia kha a beik hae. <verse number="4" style="v" />Jeshua, Bani, Kadmiel, Shebaniah, Bunni, Sherebiah, Bani te Khenani tuh Levi phin hae nawkui kya thadyn hae zah <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> mih Pachia kalan roi myarya ccae lante a sia hae. <verse number="5" style="v" />Levi phin hae Jeshua, Kadmiel, Bani, Hashabneiah, Sherebiah, Hodiah, Shebaniah te Pethahiah hae nynh, “Thadyn oh lah, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nae Pachia kha zungzae te zungzae cia thehoysah oh. Thehoynaw te phu-enaw balyn laeze hangthung athuapaw aphu-epaw na min tuh thehoyte um sah,” a ci hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Te Ezra nynh: “Nang rou nynh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> na thua; vaaw kha na rae, vaaw te vaaw kya um hae paw vaaw rhawkaw hae balyn thuasah, laephi te laephi vawlan umpaw balyn thuasah, rili te rili lungkhu umpaw balyn thuasah na rae. Mih balyn mawte hiinnaw na pya hae zah vaaw kya um hae paw nynh nang kha ae beik hae. <verse number="7" style="v" />Nang tuh Abram kha na po zah Khaldi ccungccaw hae khua Ur khua kyate na poukhae zah Abraham cite min na phutu <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> Pachia nynh na thua;<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9.7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 11:31">Gen 11.31</ref>, <ref loc="GEN 12:1">12.1</ref>, <ref loc="GEN 17:5">17.5</ref></char></note> <verse number="8" style="v" />a thinlung tuh na malang a lungzi cipaw na muih zah, Kanaan hae, Hit hae, Amor hae, Periz hae, Jebus hae te Girgash hae ram kha a ciihan hae kalan pya lan amaw kya byakinnaw na rae; te nang tuh na ding keiccuze bya na kinkupaw kha na ccingsah.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9.8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 15:18-21">Gen 15.18-21</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />“Kae minpaaw hae nynh Izip ram kya riathaenaw a teing hae paw kha na muih zah Rili Se kya mih siaruanaw kha na thaepya hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9.9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 3:7">Exo 3.7</ref>, <ref loc="EXO 14:10-12">14.10-12</ref></char></note> <verse number="10" style="v" />Faro te a ryalahtu balyn te a ramccungccaw balyn nynh kae minpaaw hae kha theihryate a cyi hae cipaw na ny keiccuze minmin kha rawsete muihsahnaw te ngaeangnaw hae kha na rae. Atunin cia a umpaw min kha namaw elang na raeku.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9.10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 7:8-12:32">Exo 7.8—12.32</ref></char></note> <verse number="11" style="v" />Minmin nynh rili kha laerou vawlan te a zua ccaw hae cite mih malang khe rili kha na phiasaku, thuasalama minmin a deehuitu hae kha athungpaw tui lungkhu lang lung accaw hawte akhupaw tui lungkhu langkhe na phung hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9.11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 14:21-29">Exo 14.21-29</ref>, <ref loc="EXO 15:4-5">15.4-5</ref></char></note> <verse number="12" style="v" />Tuhpiaze khuadae kya maeking tung te na cciakhae hae zah, khuazi kya a ccianaw hae laanpi kha awsah khylan maee tung te na cciakhae hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9.12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 13:21-22">Exo 13.21-22</ref></char></note> <verse number="13" style="v" />Sinai Mua vawlan na rungbung zah vaawlang te minmin kha bya na hopya hae;<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9.13-14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 19:18-23:33">Exo 19.18—23.33</ref></char></note> adingpaw phungzae hae, ahmepaw phungbya hae, ahoypaw phunglang hae te kawbya hae kha na pya hae, <verse number="14" style="v" />athyaapaw na sabbath kha na nysah hae zah kawbya hae, phunglang hae te phungbya kha na ryalahtu Moses kyate na pya hae. <verse number="15" style="v" />Mih vuelaw ze vaawlang te sanlou na pya hae zah mih tuihaw ze lungpi kyate na pousahpaw tui kha na pya hae, minmin pya lan bya na kinkupaw ram kha ccou khylan teenua lan na hopya hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9.15: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 16:4-15">Exo 16.4-15</ref>, <ref loc="EXO 17:1-7">17.1-7</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 1:21">Deu 1.21</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />“Thuasalama minmin te kae minpaaw hae nynh lysakute mih lungkhung zah na kawbya hae kha zui khyh hae;<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9.16-17: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 14:1-4">Nam 14.1-4</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 1:26-33">Deu 1.26-33</ref></char></note> <verse number="17" style="v" />na kawngae ry leite ei hae zah minmin laku kya na raepaw ngaeangnaw hae kha ccykekuh khyh hae;<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9.17: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 34:6">Exo 34.6</ref>; <ref loc="NUM 14:18">Nam 14.18</ref></char></note> mih lungkhung zah see lang a tangnaw hae Izip ram lang ki lan bya a paeku hae. Thuasalama nang tuh seinaw ngaethya lan paccynkute um zah thawccih thyapaw, ngaethyaumsah thyapaw, a lungsaepaw te atynpaw sungsahnaw te phe beihpaw Pachia na thua zah minmin kha na vua khyh hae. <verse number="18" style="v" />Minmin nynh vaetuataw zohtuh kha laeekute raekuh hae zah, ‘E hynh Izip ram kyate ae poukhaepaw na Pachia nynh thua,’ ci hae zah myarya lepaw saryanaw byahote a sei lya hae heize,<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9.18: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 32:1-4">Exo 32.1-4</ref></char></note> <verse number="19" style="v" />na thawccinaw myarya ale keiccuze minmin kha ramkaw kya na vua khyh hae;<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9.19-21: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 8:2-4">Deu 8.2-4</ref></char></note> laanpi a muihsah hae paw maeking tung nynh khuadae kya cciataw khyh hae zah, a ccianaw hae laanpi a awsahpaw maee tung nynh mah khuazi kya cciataw khyh hae. <verse number="20" style="v" />Minmin ccangpya nawlan na muisaw hoypaw kha na pya hae, a ae lan hae paw na manna kha pya leite na um khyh hae zah mih tuihaw byn nawlan tui na pya hae. <verse number="21" style="v" />Kum sung pali lungkhu ramkaw kya pawpaw mah ahobou lei lan looh na dang hae; mih boeining tuh pue khyh zah mih ccu tuh phin khyh. <verse number="22" style="v" />Minmin kha peenaw hae te minphuin hae kha taesahte na pya hae zah voikheit lang te voikheit lang cia na nee hae,<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9.22: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 21:21-35">Nam 21.21-35</ref></char></note> tuhcite minmin nynh Heshbon Siapharan Sihon ram te Bashan Siapharan Og ram kha a lawku hae. <verse number="23" style="v" />Mih ciihan hae kha vaawlang e awsi zeih na pungzaesah hae zah,<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9.23: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 15:5">Gen 15.5</ref>, <ref loc="GEN 22:17">22.17</ref>; <ref loc="JOS 3:14-17">Jos 3.14-17</ref></char></note> mih minpaaw hae kya teenua lan te law lan na hopya hae paw ram lungkhu langkhe na teekhae hae. <verse number="24" style="v" />Tukeiccuze mih ciihan hae nynh tee hae zah ram kha a ccou hae, mih malang khe tuin ram um hae paw Kanaan hae kha na tae hae zah mih siapharan hae te ramccungccaw hae kha mih rythyte a cyi ccaw hae cite mih kuih kya na pya hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9.24: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 11:23">Jos 11.23</ref></char></note> <verse number="25" style="v" />Minmin nynh akoihkuhpaw khua hae te a hoirumpaw ram kha lah hae zah uccaw phuinccing phe beihpaw inn hae, athaekuhpaw tuisung hae, misu khokhu hae, oliv khokhu hae te athaepaw thingku patae kha a lawku hae; tuhcite ae hae zah mih vueso zah atho hae, myarya lepaw na hoynaw kyakhe mih lungrythua.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9.25: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 6:10-11">Deu 6.10-11</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />“Tuhzemah minmin tuh kawngae khyh hae, nang kha ae dou hae zah na kawbya kha mih nulang a vua hae,<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9.26-28: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JDG 2:11-16">Bpt 2.11-16</ref></char></note> namaw kalan ki lan raeringnaw a pyatu hae na profeh hae kha theih hae zah myarya lepaw saryanaw byahote a sei hae. <verse number="27" style="v" />Tukeiccuze minmin kha teingnaw a pyatu hae mih rhaw hae kuih kalan na pya hae. A teing ccyh lya hae khe na kalan sia hae zah vaawlang te na thaepya hae, myarya lepaw na thawccinaw thyhte mih rhaw hae kuih kyate a khum hae paw khumtu hae kha na pya hae. <verse number="28" style="v" />Thuasalama haeungnaw he a mue hae te, na malang hoyleinaw bua rae hae zah mih rhaw hae nynh a uk ccaw hae cite mih rhaw hae kuih kalan na vua hae; tuhzemah minmin nynh oun ki hae zah na kalan he a sia hae te, vaawlang te na thaepah hae zah na thawccinaw thyhte avae patae na luesah hae. <verse number="29" style="v" />Minmin kha na kawbya kalan paleihsaku khylan raeringnaw na pya hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9.29: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 18:5">Lev 18.5</ref></char></note> Tuhzemah lysakuh hae zah na kawbya hae kha zui khyh hae, zuinaw liate ccungccaw hiinnaw laanpi athuapaw na phungzae hae kha rawsete a sei hae. Puasakute mih lungkhungsakuh hae zah kawngae khyh hae. <verse number="30" style="v" />Kum patae na ngaesangpah hae zah na muisaw te na profeh hae kyate raeringnaw na pya hae;<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9.30: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 17:13-18">2Si 17.13-18</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 36:15-16">2Sh 36.15-16</ref></char></note> tuhzemah ngae khyh hae. Tukeiccuze ramccang e minphuin hae kuih kalan na pya hae. <verse number="31" style="v" />Thuasalama nang tuh thawccih thyapaw te ngaethyaumsah thyapaw Pachia na thua keiccuze myarya lepaw na ngaethyaumsahnaw te mih thangnaw kha na thuasah khyh zah na vua khyh hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />“Tukeiccuze atu tuh kae Pachia, alesaepaw, athungpaw te ri lan umpaw Pachia, byakinnaw te atynpaw sungsahnaw a ccingsahtu, kae tungvaw, kae siapharan hae tungvaw, kae bawi hae, kae ranpibawi hae, kae profeh hae, kae minpaaw hae te na ccungccaw balyn tungvaw kya, Assiria siapharan hae she kyate atunin cia yn thuapaw vawsawnaw balyn hynh pawlangria leite beih um nan.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9.32: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 15:19">2Si 15.19</ref>, <ref loc="2KI 15:29">29</ref>, <ref loc="2KI 17:3-6">17.3-6</ref>; <ref loc="EZR 4:2">Ezr 4.2</ref>, <ref loc="EZR 4:10">10</ref></char></note> <verse number="33" style="v" />Kae tungvaw a thuapaw balyn kya nang tuh na ding, pawccecize nang nynh tuh lungzite na cyih zah kaening nynh tuh ahoy lei lante kae cyi; <verse number="34" style="v" />kae siapharan hae, kae bawi hae, kae ranpibawi hae te kae minpaaw hae nynh na la pya hae paw na kawbya kha zui khyh hae, na pya hae paw na kawbya hae te raeringnaw kha pawlangria khyh hae. <verse number="35" style="v" />Myarya lepaw na hoynaw te na pya hae paw mih ram, mih malang na nungpya hae paw ram lepaw te a hoirumpaw ram lungkhu khe na rya kha lah khyh hae zah ahoy leipaw mih ryalaw kha maetawkuh khyh hae. <verse number="36" style="v" />A thingthae te a lasung hoypaw kya lungpawkhaeku lan kae minpaaw hae na la pya hae paw ram lungkhu kya kaening tuh atunin see lang kae tang zah see hae nynh kae thua vae. <verse number="37" style="v" />Kae seinaw keiccuze kae luki na sangsah hae paw siapharan hae kalan khe ram a hoirumnaw thae tuh a cceih vae; kae pyn te kae sahiin hae tungvaw kya mah mih rythyte huhan thuakuh hae zah kaening tuh myaryamaw kae riathae,” a ci.</para>
  <para style="s1">Byakinnaw kya Minthuhkuh hae paw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />E hae balyn keiccuze atynpaw nawccawnaw kha raete ccaw kae zei zah kae bawi hae, kae ccungccaw Levi phin hae te kae ranpibawi hae nynh mih min kha tazeih a khia hae.</para>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tazeih khiapaw ccaw kya umpaw min hae tuh: Hakaliah ccapaw ram uktu bawi Nehemiah, Zedekiah, <verse number="2" style="v" />Seraiah, Azariah, Jeremiah, <verse number="3" style="v" />Pashhur, Amariah, Malkhijah, <verse number="4" style="v" />Hattush, Shebaniah, Malluk, <verse number="5" style="v" />Harim, Meremoth, Obadiah, <verse number="6" style="v" />Daniel, Ginnethon, Baruk, <verse number="7" style="v" />Meshullam, Abijah, Mijamin, <verse number="8" style="v" />Maaziah, Bilgai, Shemaiah, e hae tuh ranpibawi hae nynh thua. <verse number="9" style="v" />Te Levi phin hae tuh: Azaniah ccapaw Jeshua, Henadad ccapaw hae kya-e Binnui, Kadmiel; <verse number="10" style="v" />te mih uno hae, Shebaniah, Hodiah, Kelita, Pelaiah, Hanan, <verse number="11" style="v" />Mika, Rehob, Hashabiah, <verse number="12" style="v" />Zakkur, Sherebiah, Shebaniah, <verse number="13" style="v" />Hodiah, Bani, Beninu. <verse number="14" style="v" />Ccungccaw hae cciakhaetu hae tuh: Parosh, Pahath-moab, Elam, Zattu, Bani, <verse number="15" style="v" />Bunni, Azgad, Bebai, <verse number="16" style="v" />Adonijah, Bigvai, Adin, <verse number="17" style="v" />Ater, Hezekiah, Azzur, <verse number="18" style="v" />Hodiah, Hashum, Bezai, <verse number="19" style="v" />Harif, Anathoth, Nebai, <verse number="20" style="v" />Magpiash, Meshullam, Hezir, <verse number="21" style="v" />Meshezabel, Zadok, Jaddua, <verse number="22" style="v" />Pelatiah, Hanan, Anaiah, <verse number="23" style="v" />Hoshea, Hananiah, Hasshub, <verse number="24" style="v" />Hallohesh, Pilha, Shobek, <verse number="25" style="v" />Rehum, Hashabnah, Maaseiah, <verse number="26" style="v" />Ahiah, Hanan, Anan, <verse number="27" style="v" />Malluk, Harim te Baanah nynh thua hae.</para>
  <para style="s1">Byakinnaw Adynnawte</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tuhlaepaw ccungccaw hae, ranpibawi hae, Levi phin hae, sakoih ngawtu hae, hlawsahthya hae paw, beikinn ryalahtu hae te Pachia kawbya kha zui khylan ram lungkhu e ccungccaw hae kyate mimaw ccangte a um hae paw balyn tuh mih zu hae, mih ccapaw hae, mih ccanung hae ryte nynaw te thaethyanaw a hoi hae paw balyn tuh <verse number="29" style="v" />mih vaeccaw hae, mih bawi hae ryte pykuh hae zah, Pachia ryalahtu Moses kyate pyapaw Pachia kawbya kha zui khylan te <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kae Bawipaw kawbya balyn, a phungzae hae te a phungbya hae kha zuite cyi khylan thyalawkute byakinkunaw a rae hae. <verse number="30" style="v" />E ram kya-e ccungccaw hae kalan kae ccanung hae kha zu lang kae pya lan khyh hae, mih ccanung hae kha kae ccapaw hae zu lang kae hoipah lan khyh hae;<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10.30: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 34:16">Exo 34.16</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 7:3">Deu 7.3</ref></char></note> <verse number="31" style="v" />e ram kya-e ccungccaw hae nynh sabbath nin kya uccaw thuasah, looh hankhakheit thuasah zua lan oun cciakhae hae ze kaening nynh sabbath nin te ninthyaa nin kya kae re lan khyh;<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10.31: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 23:10-11">Exo 23.10-11</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 25:1-7">Lev 25.1-7</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 15:1-2">Deu 15.1-2</ref></char></note> kum sarinaw kum kya kae laephi kya looh kae ccou lan khyh zah laebah miakaw kha kae suing cih hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Kae Pachia inn ryalawnaw hanlan kum takyhte shekel pum thum pum kheit kae pya cih:<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10.32: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 30:11-16">Exo 30.11-16</ref></char></note> <verse number="33" style="v" />umkhaenaw sanlou, tyty raepaw ccathae silawnaw, tyty raepaw maee-ute silawnaw, sabbath hae, sawpaw thawpaw hae, accyh khyapaw poi hae, athyaapaw ahlu hae, Israel hae elang seishawnaw raepya nawlan seithyaanaw silawnaw te Pachia inn e rya miakaw hanlan tuhcite kae pya cih. <verse number="34" style="v" />Kawbya kya azeiku thyhte, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kae Pachia silawhang vawlan maeetua nawlan thing ahlu kha kum takyhte khyapaw accyh kyakhe mawmaw puizia raveihte kae Pachia inn lang thuakhae khylan ranpibawi hae, Levi phin hae te ccungccaw hae kha ccungthy kae dungsah cih hae. <verse number="35" style="v" />Kae laephi kya-e thaety te kae thingku miakaw kya-e thingthae balyn kya-e thaety kha kum takyhte <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> inn lang thuakhae lan thuasah,<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10.35: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 23:19">Exo 23.19</ref>, <ref loc="EXO 34:26">34.26</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 26:2">Deu 26.2</ref></char></note> <verse number="36" style="v" />kawbya kya azeiku thyhte, kae ccapaw hae kya-e ccatawccaw te kae sahiin kya-e thanty te kae vaetua phu te kae tuuphu hae kya-e thanty hae kha kae Pachia inn lang, kae Pachia inn kya ryalah hae paw ranpibawi hae kalan thuakhae lan thuasah,<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10.36: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 13:2">Exo 13.2</ref></char></note> <verse number="37" style="v" />te masaty kae ruepaw ccathae kya-e vaekhui, ahlu hae, thingthae thaety miakaw, misutui te chitui kha ranpibawi hae kalan, kae Pachia inn akhaan lungkhu lang thuakhae lan thuasah, te khua taraw miakaw kya pumhaw pumkheit a ccakhungtu hae tuh Levi phin hae athua hae keiccuze kae laephi kyate apoupaw looh pumhaw pumkheit kha Levi phin hae kalan thuakhae lan cite bya kae kinku.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10.37: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 18:21">Nam 18.21</ref></char></note> <verse number="38" style="v" />Levi phin hae nynh pumhaw pumkheit kha a law vae hae ze, Aaron ciihan ranpibawi tuh a umbua cih; te Levi phin hae nynh pumhaw pumkheit hae kya-e pumhaw pumkheit kha kae Pachia inn, sisuakhaan kya akhaan lungkhu lang a nung cih hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10.38: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 18:26">Nam 18.26</ref></char></note> <verse number="39" style="v" />Israel hae te Levi ccapaw hae nynh looh, misutui te chitui ahlu hae kha beikinnthyaa angphe hae a umnaw uccawkhaan hae kalan te ryalahtu ranpibawi hae, sakoih ngawtu hae te hlawsahtu hae a umnaw hae khaan kalan a thuakhae cih hae. Kae Pachia inn kha kae sawphah lan khyh.</para>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" />
  <para style="s">Jerusalem Milu Alungthung</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ccungccaw zapi cciakhaetu hae tuh Jerusalem khua kya a um hae; tuhlaepaw ccungccaw hae tuh Jerusalem khua thyaapaw kya lu haw kyaze lu kheit um khylan ccungthy a dung hae, lu haw kyaze lu takua tuh ccangpaw khua hae kya a um hae. <verse number="2" style="v" />Jerusalem khua kya um lan mimaw lungthote a paccynkuh hae paw balyn kha ccungccaw hae nynh hythua a pya hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />E hae tuh Jerusalem kya um hae paw pee kya-e cciakhaetu hae nynh thua; thuasalama Judah ram e khua hae kyakhe Israel hae, ranpibawi hae, Levi phin hae, beikinn ryalahtu hae te Solomon a ryalahtu hae ciihan hae tuh mih uccaw a umnaw mimaw khua raveih kya a um hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11.3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NEH 7:73">Neh 7.73</ref></char></note> <verse number="4" style="v" />Judah phin hae abang te Benjamin phin hae abang tuh Jerusalem kya a um hae. Judah phin hae tuh: Athaiah, aning tuh Uzziah ccapaw, Uzziah tuh Zekhariah ccapaw, Zekhariah tuh Amariah ccapaw, Amariah tuh Shefatiah ccapaw, Shefatiah tuh Mahalalel ccapaw, Mahalalel tuh Perez ciihan kya-e nynh thua; <verse number="5" style="v" />te Maaseiah, aning tuh Baruk ccapaw, Baruk tuh Kolhozeh ccapaw, Kolhozeh tuh Hazaiah ccapaw, Hazaiah tuh Adaiah ccapaw, Adaiah tuh Joiarib ccapaw, Joiarib tuh Zekhariah ccapaw, Zekhariah tuh Shelah ciihan nynh thua. <verse number="6" style="v" />Jerusalem kya um hae paw Perez ciihan hae tuh arawthungpaw rhawkaw hae za pali sung taruh lu tarya acih hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Benjamin ciihan hae tuh: Sallu tuh Meshullam ccapaw, Meshullam tuh Joed ccapaw, Joed tuh Pedaiah ccapaw, Pedaiah tuh Kolaiah ccapaw, Kolaiah tuh Maaseiah ccapaw, Maaseiah tuh Ithiel ccapaw, Ithiel tuh Jeshaiah ccapaw nynh thua. <verse number="8" style="v" />Sallu uno hae tuh Gabbai te Sallai: za takua lu kuin acih hae. <verse number="9" style="v" />Zikhri ccapaw Joel tuh mih cciakhaetu thua zah, Hassenuah ccapaw Judah tuh khuabawi a zuipaw lu ningnaw bawi nynh thua.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ranpibawi hae tuh: Joiarib ccapaw Jedaiah te Jakhin; <verse number="11" style="v" />Seraiah tuh Hilkiah ccapaw, Hilkiah tuh Meshullam ccapaw, Meshullam tuh Zadok ccapaw, Zadok tuh Meraioth ccapaw, Meraioth tuh Ahitub ccapaw, Ahitub tuh Pachia inn do-oihtu bawi thua, <verse number="12" style="v" />inn rya a lah hae paw uno hae tuh za tarya lu kuin lae ning acih hae; Adaiah tuh Jehoram ccapaw, Jehoram tuh Pelaliah ccapaw, Pelaliah tuh Amzi ccapaw, Amzi tuh Zekhariah ccapaw, Zekhariah tuh Pashhur ccapaw, Pashhur tuh Malkhijah ccapaw, <verse number="13" style="v" />a uno hae, puizia kya-e lu hae ryte za ning sung pali lu ning acih hae; te Amashai tuh Azarel ccapaw, Azarel tuh Ahazi ccapaw, Ahazi tuh Meshillemoth ccapaw, Meshillemoth tuh Immer ccapaw, <verse number="14" style="v" />te mih uno hae, arawthungpaw rhawkaw hae tuh za kheit lu kuin lae tarya acih hae; mih cciakhaetu tuh Haggedolim ccapaw Zabdiel nynh thua.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Levi phin hae tuh: Hasshub ccapaw Shemaiah thua zah, Hasshub tuh Azrikam ccapaw, Azrikam tuh Hashabiah ccapaw, Hashabiah tuh Bunni ccapaw nynh thua; <verse number="16" style="v" />te Levi phin hae kya-e cciakhaetu hae Shabbethai te Jozabad nynh Pachia inn atolang e rya kha a do hae; <verse number="17" style="v" />te Mikah ccapaw Mattaniah thua zah, Mikah tuh Zabdi ccapaw, Zabdi tuh Asaf ccapaw, Asaf tuh lungtua sawsangnaw kyaze hlaw cciakhaetu nynh thua, te Bakbukiah tuh a uno hae kyaze lu ningnaw nynh thua; te Shammua ccapaw Abda thua zah, Shammua tuh Galal ccapaw, Galal tuh Jeduthun ccapaw nynh thua. <verse number="18" style="v" />Khua thyaapaw kya um hae paw Levi phin hae tuh mih balynte za ning sung tarya lu pali acih hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Sakoih ngawtu hae Akkub, Talmon te sakoih ngawtu mih uno hae tuh za kheit sung sari lu ning acih hae. <verse number="20" style="v" />Tuhlaepaw Israel hae, ranpibawi hae te Levi phin hae tuh Judah khua hae miakaw kya, mih balyn te mih rho raveih kya a um hae. <verse number="21" style="v" />Thuasalama beikinn ryalahtu hae tuh Ofel kya a um hae; Ziha te Gishpa nynh beikinn ryalahtu hae kha a uk hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Jerusalem kya umpaw Levi phin hae cciakhaetu tuh Bani ccapaw Uzzi nynh thua, Bani tuh Hashabiah ccapaw, Hashabiah tuh Mattaniah ccapaw, Mattaniah tuh Mika ccapaw, Mika tuh Asaf ciihan thua zah, Asaf ciihan hlawsahtu hae tuh Pachia inn rya a do-oihtu hae nynh thua. <verse number="23" style="v" />Pawccecize minmin te asekuh lante, hlawsahtu hae hanlan nin takyh ahopaw looh kha pya athua cih hae cite siapharan nynh kaw a pya hae. <verse number="24" style="v" />Judah ccapaw Zerah ciihan Meshezabel ccapaw Pethahiah tuh Persia siapharan kuihkaw e bawi thua zah Israel ccungccaw hae te asekuhpaw rya miakaw a lahtu nynh thua.</para>
  <para style="s1">Jerusalem Atolang e Khua hae</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Khua taraw hae te mih loo hae kong tuh hynhte nynh thua, Judah ccungccaw hae abang tuh Kiriath-arba te a khua taraw hae, Dibon te a khua taraw hae, Jekabzeel te a khua taraw hae, <verse number="26" style="v" />Jeshua khua, Moladah khua, Bethpelet khua, <verse number="27" style="v" />Hazar-shual khua, Beersheba khua te a khua taraw hae kya, <verse number="28" style="v" />Ziklag, Mekonah te a khua taraw hae kya, <verse number="29" style="v" />Enrimmon, Zorah, Jarmuth, <verse number="30" style="v" />Zanoah, Adullam te a khua taraw hae, Lakhish te a loo hae, Azekah te a khua taraw hae kya a um hae. Tuhcite Beersheba kyate Hinnom accya cia a um hae. <verse number="31" style="v" />Benjamin ccungccaw hae nynh mah Geba, Mikmash, Aija, Bethel te a khua taraw hae, <verse number="32" style="v" />Anathoth, Nob, Ananiah, <verse number="33" style="v" />Hazor, Ramah, Gittaim, <verse number="34" style="v" />Hadid, Zeboim, Neballat, <verse number="35" style="v" />Lod, Ono te kuihhae hoy hae paw accya kya a um hae. <verse number="36" style="v" />Judah ram kya um hae paw Levi phin hae phu abang tuh Benjamin ram kya a pykuh bua hae.</para>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Ranpibawi hae te Levi Phin hae</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Shealtiel ccapaw Zerubbabel te Jeshua ryte a cceihthung hae paw ranpibawi hae te Levi phin hae tuh: Seraiah, Jeremiah, Ezra, <verse number="2" style="v" />Amariah, Malluk, Hattush, <verse number="3" style="v" />Shekaniah, Rehum, Meremoth, <verse number="4" style="v" />Iddo, Ginnethoi, Abijah, <verse number="5" style="v" />Mijamin, Maadiah, Bilgah, <verse number="6" style="v" />Shemaiah, Joiarib, Jedaiah, <verse number="7" style="v" />Sallu, Amok, Hilkiah, Jedaiah. E hae tuh Jeshua she lyaze ranpibawi hae te mih uno hae kya cciakhaetu hae nynh thua.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Levi phin hae tuh: Jeshua, Binnui, Kadmiel, Sherebiah, Judah te Mattaniah, Mattaniah tuh a uno hae ryte lungtuanaw hlaw a synriatu nynh thua hae. <verse number="9" style="v" />Te mih uno hae Bakbukiah te Unno tuh hlawsah vae ze minmin te arawsekunaw khe a thadyn hae. <verse number="10" style="v" />Jeshua tuh Joiakim paaw, Joiakim tuh Eliashib paaw, Eliashib tuh Joiada paaw, <verse number="11" style="v" />Joiada tuh Jonathan paaw, Jonathan tuh Jaddua paaw nynh thua.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Joiakim she lyaze puizia hae kya lu athua hae paw ranpibawi hae tuh: Seraiah ciihan kyaze Meraiah, Jeremiah ciihan kyaze Hananiah, <verse number="13" style="v" />Ezra ciihan kyaze Meshullam, Amariah ciihan kyaze Jehohanan, <verse number="14" style="v" />Mallukhi ciihan kyaze Jonathan, Shebaniah ciihan kyaze Josef, <verse number="15" style="v" />Harim ciihan kyaze Adna, Meraioth ciihan kyaze Halkai, <verse number="16" style="v" />Iddo ciihan kyaze Zekhariah, Ginnethon ciihan kyaze Meshullam, <verse number="17" style="v" />Abijah ciihan kyaze Zikhri, Miniamin ciihan kyaze, Moadiah ciihan kyaze Pittai, <verse number="18" style="v" />Bilgah ciihan kyaze Shammua, Shemaiah ciihan kyaze Jehonathan, <verse number="19" style="v" />Joiarib ciihan kyaze Mattenai, Jedaiah ciihan kyaze Mattenai, Jedaiah ciihan kyaze Uzzi, <verse number="20" style="v" />Sallai ciihan kyaze Kallai, Amok ciihan kyaze Eber, <verse number="21" style="v" />Hilkiah ciihan kyaze Hashabiah, Jedaiah ciihan kyaze Nethanel.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Eliashib, Joiada, Johanan te Jaddua she kya Levi phin hae puizia hae kya-e lu hae te ranpibawi hae kha Persia siapharan Darias uknaw kyacia mih min ccazing law athua hae. <verse number="23" style="v" />Levi phin hae, puizia hae kya-e lu hae kha Eliashib ccapaw Johanan she kyacia Sherianaw Ccauh kya mih min ccazing zei athua hae. <verse number="24" style="v" />Levi phin hae cciakhaetu hae Hashabiah, Sherebiah te Kadmiel ccapaw Jeshua tuh mih uno hae ryte Pachia ccungccapaw David kawpyanaw thyhte thehoysah khylan te lungtuabya ho khylan aphuphute a hawiliakuh hae. <verse number="25" style="v" />Mattaniah, Bakbukiah, Obadiah, Meshullam, Talmon te Akkub tuh sakoih kya-e sisuainn kya thadyn lante sakoih ngawtu nynh thua hae. <verse number="26" style="v" />E hae tuh Jozadak ccapaw Jeshua a ccapaw Joiakim she, uktu bawi Nehemiah she lyate kawbya sazaepaw ranpibawi Ezra she kya a um hae.</para>
  <para style="s1">Khua A Koihpaw Khualungrua Apnaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Jerusalem khualungrua apnaw kyakhe lanchi, tintang te tang-oi hae kha khuakute lungpawnaw te, lungtuabya hote, hlawsahte apnaw poi kha tua khylan Levi phin hae kha Jerusalem lang cciakhae khylan mih umnaw miakaw kya a ccung hae. <verse number="28" style="v" />Hlawsahtu aphu hae tuh Jerusalem khua pepan kyate, Netofah pepan e khua taraw hae kyate, <verse number="29" style="v" />Beth-gilgal kyate, Geba te Azmaveth pee hae kyate mah pynkheihlan a pumkuh hae; pawccecize hlawsahtu hae nynh Jerusalem pepan khe khua taraw hae kha a raeku hae. <verse number="30" style="v" />Ranpibawi hae te Levi phin hae nynh mimaw kha thyaasakuh hae zah, ccungccaw hae, sakoih hae te khualungrua kha mah a thyaasah hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Judah cciakhaetu hae kha khualungrua vawlan ka cciakhae hae zah lungtuanaw hlawsahtu aphupi phu ning lang ka nung hae. Phu kheit tuh ranglang khe khualungrua vawlan te Athupaw Koikua kalan a cceih hae; <verse number="32" style="v" />minmin nulang te Hoshaiah te Judah bawi hae angankuh, <verse number="33" style="v" />Azariah, Ezra, Meshullam, <verse number="34" style="v" />Judah, Benjamin, Shemaiah te Jeremiah, <verse number="35-36" style="v" />mungkae a ccyng hae paw ranpibawi ccangvae hae abang tuh a cceih hae, tuh-e hae tuh: Zekhariah te a uno hae Shemaiah, Azarel, Milalai, Gilalai, Maai, Nethanel, Judah te Hanani thua hae zah minmin nynh Pachia ccungccapaw David kya-e khuakupaw uccaw hae ccyngkute a zui hae; kawbya sazaepaw Ezra tuh mih malang khe a cceih. Zekhariah tuh Jonathan ccapaw, Jonathan tuh Shemaiah ccapaw, Shemaiah tuh Mattaniah ccapaw, Mattaniah tuh Mikaiah ccapaw, Mikaiah tuh Zakkur ccapaw, Zakkur tuh Asaf ccapaw nynh thua. <verse number="37" style="v" />Mih malang e Tuidy Sakoih kya thua hae zah khualungrua kaenaw David khua nawkui kyate lawbabin lan kaethung hae zah David inn luki, nithua lang e Tui Koikua kyacia a cceih hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Lungtuanaw hlawsahtu hae ccangpaw phu kheit tuh voilang cceih hae zah, kae te ccungccaw hae angankuh nynh khualungrua vawlan te Sanlou Ruanaw Innhangpaw luki, Akopaw Khualungrua kyacia kae zui hae. <verse number="39" style="v" />Efraim Koikua luki, Koikua Rynpaw, Ngasaw Koikua, Hananel Innhangpaw, Azah Innhangpaw te Tuu Koikua kyacia kae cceih; te minmin tuh Ngawtu Sakoih kya a thadyn hae. <verse number="40" style="v" />Tuhcite lungtuanaw hlawsahtu phu ning hae tuh parouh mawte Pachia inn kya thadyn hae zah, kae te bawi hae angankuh mah kae thadynbua; <verse number="41" style="v" />ranpibawi hae Eliakim, Maaseiah, Miniamin, Mikaiah, Elioenai, Zekhariah te Hananiah tuh mungkae ccyngkute a thadyn hae; <verse number="42" style="v" />Maaseiah, Shemaiah, Eleazar, Uzzi, Jehohanan, Malkhijah, Elam te Ezer mah a thadyn hae. Hlawsahtu hae tuh Jezrahiah nynh lupi lang umpyate hlaw a sah hae. <verse number="43" style="v" />Tuin nin khe silawnaw pipi kha rae hae zah mih lungpaw, pawccecize Pachia nynh myarya lepaw lungpawnaw kha a pya hae. Jerusalem lungpawnaw roi tuh laansawpi te a thae hae.</para>
  <para style="s1">Beikinn Ryalaw hae</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Kawbya thyhte ccou lan ccan zah ranpibawi hae te Levi phin hae hanlan tuh-e khua hae loo kya-e a suelua hae paw ahlu hae, thaety hae te pumhaw pumkheit hae ccakhungnawpaw akhaan hae a do-oihtu ccungccaw hae kha tuin nin kya a khang hae; pawccecize Judah hae tuh ryalahtu ranpibawi hae te Levi phin hae tungvaw mih lungpaw. <verse number="45" style="v" />David te a ccapaw Solomon nynh kawpya hae thyhte, hlawsahtu hae te sakoih ngawtu hae nynh a cyi hae hawte, mih Pachia rya te thyaasahkunaw rya kha minmin nynh a law hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12.45: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CH 25:1-8">1Sh 25.1-8</ref>, <ref loc="1CH 26:12">26.12</ref></char></note> <verse number="46" style="v" />Pawccecize langmawlya David te Asaf she lyakhe Pachia thehoysahnaw te lungtuabya honawpaw hlaw hae la um zah a sahkhaetu lupi mah a um. <verse number="47" style="v" />Zerubbabel she te Nehemiah she lyakhe Israel hae balyn nynh hlawsahtu hae te sakoih ngawtu hae hanlan nin takyh a ccou lan hae paw kha a pya hae. Levi phin hae nynh a ccou lan hae paw kha taekhiate a nung hae; te Aaron ciihan hae nynh a ccou lan hae paw kha Levi phin hae nynh taekhiate a nungpya hae.</para>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Ramccang hae A Phiakuh hae</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tuin nin khe ccungccaw hae a thaenaw hae khe Moses ccauh kha a ria hae; tuh-e ccauh lungkhu khe Ammon hae te Moab hae humhung mah Pachia ccungccaw hae a pumkuh hae paw kalan tee lan khyh hae cite azeikuhpaw kha a muih hae,<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13.1-2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 23:3-5">Deu 23.3-5</ref></char></note> <verse number="2" style="v" />pawccecize minmin nynh Israel hae kha sanlou te tui te cciadue leite, minmin kha thyalaw khylan Balaam kha a hohnua hae—tuhzemah ah Pachia nynh thyalawnaw kha hythuanaw lang a paleih.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13.2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 22:1-6">Nam 22.1-6</ref></char></note> <verse number="3" style="v" />Ccungccaw hae nynh kawbya kha he a thae hae te, ramccang ciihan hae balyn kha Israel hae kyate a phia hae.</para>
  <para style="s1">Nehemiah nynh A Raethui hae paw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />E mawze, ah Pachia inn e akhaan hae do-oihtu lang a nung hae paw, Tobiah ryte anaekuh hae paw ranpibawi Eliashib nynh <verse number="5" style="v" />ccathae silawnaw, mynkhuhpaw, angphe hae thuasah, kawbya thyhte Levi phin hae, hlawsahtu hae te sakoih ngawtu hae a pya hae paw ccathae, misutui, chitui pumhaw pumkheit thuasah, ranpibawi hae elang a hlu hae paw ahlu hae thuasah langmawlya a la nungnaw hae paw akhaan lepaw kha Tobiah hanlan a paccynpya. <verse number="6" style="v" />E acyiku lya hynh kae tuh Jerusalem kya ka um khyh, pawccecize Babilon Siapharan Artazaksis nynh siapharan lang a tangnaw sung thum kum ningnaw kum kya siapharan kalan ka cceih. Sosoh koute siapharan kha akhue ka ngiakuh zah <verse number="7" style="v" />Jerusalem lang ka ki. Te Eliashib nynh Tobiah hanlan Pachia inn voidu lungkhu kya akhaan paccynpah zah hoyleinaw kha a rae cipaw ka ny. <verse number="8" style="v" />Ka thin myarya ria zah Tobiah innbyn kya-e uccaw balyn kha akhaan lungkhu te ka vua. <verse number="9" style="v" />Te kaw ka pya hae zah akhaan hae kha ccikan hae zah, Pachia inn angphe hae kha ccathae silawnaw te mynkhuhpaw hae ryte ka kikhae hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Levi phin hae kha mih hanpaw pya khyh hae cipaw kha mah ka muih; tukeiccuze beikinn rya a lah hae paw Levi phin hae te hlawsahtu hae tuh mimaw loo raveih lang a cceih vae hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13.10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 12:19">Deu 12.19</ref></char></note> <verse number="11" style="v" />Tukeiccuze bawi hae kha ka bo hae zah, “Pawccemou Pachia inn tuh vua athua?” ka cipya hae. Minmin kha ka pum hae zah mih umnaw hmin kya ka nung hae. <verse number="12" style="v" />Te Judah hae balyn nynh looh, misutui te chitui pumhaw pumkheit kha sisuainn lang a thuakhae hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13.12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAL 3:10">Mal 3.10</ref></char></note> <verse number="13" style="v" />Te sisuainn a uktu suaccytu hae lang ranpibawi Shelemaih, kawbya sazaepaw Zadok te Levi phin athuapaw Pedaiah kha ka khang hae, minmin a bawmtu hae lang Mattaniah ccapaw Zakkur a ccapaw Hanan kha ka khang, pawccecize minmin tuh mih lungzi cite tua athua hae; minmin nynh mih uno hae kalan uccaw neepaw rya kha a law hae. <verse number="14" style="v" />Pou ka Pachia, e konglang te kae hynh beih yn ning nan, ka Pachia inn hanlan te a ryalaw hanlan ahoypaw rya ka lawpaw hynh beih yn ningpah nan.</para>
  <para style="s1">Sabbath Nin kya Haeungsahnaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tuin ccyh lyaze ccungccaw hae nynh Judah ram kya sabbath nin khe misu mia hae zah ccathae patae kha lah hae zah lann tungvaw a phusah hae paw kha ka muih; misutui, misu thae, thaekute phupaw aphuinphuin kha sabbath nin kya Jerusalem lang a phu hae paw kha mah ka muih; looh a zua nin hae khe raeringnaw ka pya hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13.15: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 20:8-10">Exo 20.8-10</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 5:12-14">Deu 5.12-14</ref>; <ref loc="JER 17:21-22">Jer 17.21-22</ref></char></note> <verse number="16" style="v" />Tuh-e khuapi kya um hae paw Tair ccungccaw hae nynh ngasaw te uccaw aphuinphuin kha oun cciakhae hae zah sabbath nin khe Judah ccungccaw hae kalan te Jerusalem khua kya a zua hae. <verse number="17" style="v" />Tetuh Judah bawi hae kha ka bo hae zah, “Sabbath nin kha na thusah oh zah, e hoyleinaw na rae oh paw hynh pawtemou athua? <verse number="18" style="v" />Nae minpaaw hae nynh hynhte a cyi hae keiccuze e ronaw balyn hynh aening tungvaw te e khuapi kya ah Pachia nynh thuasah khyh tou? Tuhzemah nanning nynh sabbath kha thusahte Israel tungvaw kya thinrianaw kha houh na thuakhae oh,” ka cipya hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Sabbath nin athua maw Jerusalem koikua hae kya he amoh takaw te, thuakaw hae kha khaw athua cih cite kaw ka pya hae zah sabbath nin athang mawlaezung thuakaw hae kha hung thua lan khyh cite kaw ka tho. Sabbath nin kya pawpaw uccaw mah khua lungkhu lang teekhae athua khyh nawlan, ka ryalahtu hae abang kha koikua hae kya ka nung hae. <verse number="20" style="v" />Tetuh kungku hae te uccaw aphuinphuin a zuatu hae tuh Jerusalem khua atolang khe vae kheit vae ning a rya hae. <verse number="21" style="v" />Thuasalama minmin kha raeringnaw ka pya hae zah, “Pawccemou khualungrua pe na rya oh? Hynhte bua na cyi oh ze, kae kyng cih oh,” ka cipya hae. Tuin ccyh te vae tuh sabbath nin kya oun thua vae khyh hae. <verse number="22" style="v" />Sabbath nin kha thyaasah khylan Levi phin hae nynh mimaw te mimaw thyaasakute oun cceih hae zah koikua hae kha a ngaw nawlan hae kaw ka pya hae. Pou ka Pachia, e kong keiccuze kae hynh yn ning nan, atynpaw na sungsahnaw tuh ale thyhte kae hynh ngaethya beih yn umsah.</para>
  <para style="s1">Minphuin Ccangpaw hae te Zuvaw Tangnaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tuin ccyh lyakhe Ashdod nopi hae, Ammon nopi hae te Moab nopi hae ryte zuvaw lang tang hae paw Judah hae kha mah ka muih hae;<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13.23-25: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 34:11-16">Exo 34.11-16</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 7:1-5">Deu 7.1-5</ref></char></note> <verse number="24" style="v" />mih ccaaw hae angankuh tuh Ashdod bya kha ho hae zah Judah bya kha hothya khyh hae, ccangpaw minphuin hae bya aphuinphuin kha a ho hae. <verse number="25" style="v" />Te minmin kha ka seisah hae zah thya ka law hae, minmin abang kha ka zia hae zah mih sang te ka sue hae; Pachia min te bya ka kinsakuh hae zah, “Nae ccanung hae kha mih ccapaw hae zu lang na pya lan khyh oh, mih ccanung hae kha nae ccapaw hae hanlan thuasah, naemaw hanlan thuasah zu lang na dy lan khyh oh. <verse number="26" style="v" />Solomon Siapharan tuh tuhcihawpaw nopi hae keiccuze sei khyh tou? Minphuin patae hae laku kya aning tahawpaw siapharan um khyh, a Pachia nynh sungsah zah Israel hae balyn a uktu siapharan lang a khang; thuasalama ramccang nopi hae nynh aning kha heize seinaw a raesah hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13.26: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 12:24-25">2Sa 12.24-25</ref>; <ref loc="1KI 11:1-8">1Si 11.1-8</ref></char></note> <verse number="27" style="v" />Kaening nynh nanning bya kha ngae lan zah ramccang nopi hae kha zu lang dykute myarya lepaw e hoyleinaw balyn hynh raete kae Pachia tungvaw kya lungzi leite kae um cih zawtou?” ka cipya hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Ranpibawi lupi Eliashib ccapaw Jehoiada a ccapaw lu kheit tuh Horon ccungccaw Sanballat paeepaw athua keiccuze ka kyate ka dee.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13.28: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NEH 4:1">Neh 4.1</ref></char></note> <verse number="29" style="v" />Pou ka Pachia, minmin nynh ranpibawi thuanaw kha thuasah, ranpibawi hae byakinnaw te Levi phin hae byakinnaw kha thuasah a thusah hae keiccuze minmin kha syntaw hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tuhcite Judah hae kha ramccang hae te asekuhpaw atyn-are kyate ka thyaasah hae zah, ranpibawi hae te Levi phin hae kha mimaw rya raveih kya ka nung hae; <verse number="31" style="v" />accyh khyapaw kya silawnaw lanpaw thing ahlu te thaety hanlan kha ka pya hae. Pou ka Pachia, hoynaw ka ccou nawlan yn ning nan.</para>
</usx>